ind":"announcement","title":"LAUNCH TRAILER & RELEASE DATE","summary":"🚀 DARK EYES – SUPER SOLDIER 2 | OFFICIAL LAUNCH TRAILERThe final battle is approaching.Humanity is fighting for survival against the Dark Eyes. As the enemy forces grow stronger, the Earth Space Defense Force faces its greatest threat yet.Step into the armor of the Super Soldier, fight alongside ESDF marines, unleash devastating firepower, and take the fight to the enemy in an action-packed 2D sci-fi shooter.🎬 Watch the official launch trailer now!LINK: 📅 OFFICIAL RELEASE DATE CONFIRMED!November","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T19:20:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030096","verified_at":"2026-10-22T00:10:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4769690-1846651706681660","game_id":"steam-4769690","kind":"announcement","title":"Dark Eyes – Super Soldier 2 Joins Steam Next Fest!","summary":"We're excited to announce that Dark Eyes – Super Soldier 2 is participating in Steam Next Fest! Get ready for intense 2D sci-fi combat, massive battles between the Earth Space Defense Force and the alien Delma (AKA Dark Eyes), and a story-driven military campaign.The demo is already available to play now!Jump into the action, experience the battlefield, and let us know what you think.If you enjoy the demo, don't forget to wishlist Dark Eyes – Super Soldier 2 to support the game and stay informed","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T14:17:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681660","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4769690-1844115010496224","game_id":"steam-4769690","kind":"announcement","title":"Gameplay Trailer 60 FPS","summary":"Hey everyone!A while back I mentioned the gameplay trailer on Youtube. Recently I noticed it was only on 24 FPS. So I reuploaded it with the 60 frames per second!!! Ow yeahhh....Enjoy the remastered experience!Trailer: Gameplay Trailer Dark Eyes - Super Soldier HIGH QUALITY","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T22:43:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010496224","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4769690-1843481262690491","game_id":"steam-4769690","kind":"announcement","title":"Sarge Explains!","summary":"“LISTEN UP, SKINNY BOY!”The Dark Eyes are at our doorstep.And they'd love nothing more than to rip out your guts, marinate 'em, cook 'em, and have you for dinner!Lucky for you, I'm here to keep your sorry ass alive and teach you what we're up against.Check out all the Sarge toturials on my YT channel: SARGE EXPLAINS - Dark Eye GruntSARGE EXPLAINS - Dark Eye EnforcerSARGE EXPLAINS - DARK EYE CONDUITSARGE EXPLAINS - DARK EYE SWARM... and more releasing this week and the next!!!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T22:02:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262690491","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4769690-1842846814438799","game_id":"steam-4769690","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update","summary":"Hey all!Just uploaded a new demo.Fixed some issues Shield pickup is now stored when you die (previously you would lose it on reloading checkpoint)Some issue on the hiding mechanic is fixedDelma Grenade launcher icon was incorrect and has been replacedNew featuresArea in which you had to evade turret fire has been turned into small boss fightComic previews have been updated (enhanced with AI)Mission select menu (so you can replay a specific mission)Graphic detail selected (on high by default)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T23:34:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814438799","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4769690-1842212951311665","game_id":"steam-4769690","kind":"announcement","title":"Gameplay Trailer","summary":"Hey all!!I have been working my ass off these last months and I finalized most of the campaign. Soon I am going to reupload the demo so you can play the demo without issues (there were a couple I noticed).Also, I made a new gameplay trailer featuring gameplay from the full campaign.Enjoy! (Trailer is also on the steam page)Trailer:Dark Eyes Super Soldier 2 Gameplay Trailer","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T23:11:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951311665","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4769690-1833968530898768","game_id":"steam-4769690","kind":"announcement","title":"The Super Soldier is Back!","summary":"Hey Everyone!Dark Eyes - Super Soldier is coming back with a fresh new part 2! In this part the story of the super soldier continues in the war between the Earth Space Defense Force and the Dark Eyes (AKA Delma).You get to experience more epic battles, face new enemies, and get to use more advanced weapons than before. Come check it out and play the demo now!Trailer:","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-01T21:09:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530898768","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:07Z","discovery_method":"